cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or its measurements, please cite it."
title: "colophon: a conformance and provenance census of AI-derived DICOM objects in the NCI Imaging Data Commons"
abstract: >-
  A measurement study of the 481,750 derived-object series in NCI Imaging Data
  Commons release v24. Measures DICOM conformance with independent third-party
  validators against a stated validator floor, measures disagreement between
  those validators, and measures whether the objects identify the analysis that
  produced them. Develops no model and repairs no object.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Patil
    given-names: Digvijay
license: MIT
keywords:
  - DICOM
  - conformance
  - provenance
  - Imaging Data Commons
  - medical imaging informatics
  - measurement study
repository-code: "https://github.com/Volkopat/colophon"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-03"
